    turnFlow: "The game begins with aces (or a chosen rank). The first player plays one or more cards face down, claiming they are aces. Play proceeds clockwise with next rank (2s, then 3s, etc.). After kings, it cycles back to aces. Players can play honestly or bluff. After any play, any other player can challenge by calling 'Bullshit!', 'Cheat!', or 'I Doubt It!'. The played cards are revealed. If the player was lying, they take the entire discard pile. If telling truth, the challenger takes the pile. The winner is first to empty their hand.",
